/getting-started/migration-guide#styling","content":"Do not import src-v2/styles/* from the npm package. Use the registry install so the theme is written to your app CSS."},"3232":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-204","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#lists","content":"ActionList and ActionInfiniteList are removed in v1. Pick the v1 replacement by intent:"},"3233":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-205","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#lists","content":"Action menu (each item fires a callback, no value binding) → DropdownMenu."},"3234":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-206","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#lists","content":"Searchable value picker → Combobox. Hierarchical → Command + Popover."},"3235":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-207","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#lists","content":"Display row or detail list → Item + ItemGroup. Use size=\"list\" for select-option density."},"3236":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-208","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#lists","content":"Searchable command panel (you own search, loading, paging, empty text) → Command."},"3237":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-209","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#treeselect","content":"Move TreeSelect screens to a Command + Popover recipe.\nThe old component owned more data behavior. In v1, the screen owns the path, search value, loading state, and child loading. See the Command Storybook HierarchicalPicker story for the r